e claim as drafted, because it rests on misleading RFI dates and would damage credibility. Commission an independent delay analysis, focused on CO-09 and the crane, before 1 December, and ask for more time if needed. Do not discipline the superintendent. Do not suspend the incentive scheme yet.\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ea3Q3R9JAqsNhjy7M52Fui","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
